      "height": 100,
      "text": "install adna-canvas-std (preferred)"
    },
    {
      "id": "fallback",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 936,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "2nd sys.path entry (fresh-node)"
    },
    {
      "id": "mermaid_src",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 216,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 1857,
      "text": "```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    vault(\"Canvas.aDNA\")\n    shelf_std[\"SHELF A · what/code/ — the Standard\"]\n    shelf_pro[\"SHELF B · what/production/ — the engine\"]\n    canvas_std([\"canvas_std (lean, zero-dep)\"])\n    canvas_core[\"canvas_core (~80 files)\"]\n    siblings[\"canvas_comic · canvas_presentation\"]\n    locator[\"CANVAS_CORE_HOME (locator)\"]\n    alias[\"CANVASFORGE_CODE (deprecated alias)\"]\n    trap{\"TRAP · silent non-render\"}\n    install[\"install adna-canvas-std (preferred)\"]\n    fallback[\"2nd sys.path entry (fresh-node)\"]\n    vault --> shelf_std\n    vault --> shelf_pro\n    shelf_std --> canvas_std\n    shelf_pro --> canvas_core\n    shelf_pro --> siblings\n    canvas_core -->|hard import (core.py)| canvas_std\n    siblings -->|bare cross-import → co-locate| canvas_core\n    locator -->|places on sys.path| canvas_core\n    alias -->|DeprecationWarning| locator\n    locator -->|canvas_std NOT placed| trap\n    trap -->|resolution A| install\n    trap -->|resolution B| fallback\n    install --> canvas_std\n    fallback --> canvas_std\n```"
    }
  ],
